[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11402.269, "timestamp": "03:10:02", "text": "证据。它看起来像一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11406.07, "timestamp": "03:10:06", "text": "阻止恶魔。它看起来像一只蚂蚁。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11407.83, "timestamp": "03:10:07", "text": "不知道。它仍然萦绕在人们心头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11416.389, "timestamp": "03:10:16", "text": "我应该死了。是的。是的。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11419.11, "timestamp": "03:10:19", "text": "外部。很多。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11421.389, "timestamp": "03:10:21", "text": "我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11425.11, "timestamp": "03:10:25", "text": "知道。妈的。真的是他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11426.79, "timestamp": "03:10:26", "text": "实际上瞬间就把我秒了，但我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11428.469, "timestamp": "03:10:28", "text": "知道。我认为狩猎是你可以去的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11432.469, "timestamp": "03:10:32", "text": "顺便提一下。你确定吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11433.99, "timestamp": "03:10:33", "text": "是的。是的，没关系。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11435.83, "timestamp": "03:10:35", "text": "好的。你可以进去。你刚才去哪儿了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11439.51, "timestamp": "03:10:39", "text": "死了吗？是的，它就在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11442.63, "timestamp": "03:10:42", "text": "像朋友一样。哦，我看到你了。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11450.15, "timestamp": "03:10:50", "text": "别担心，你很安全。继续。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11451.51, "timestamp": "03:10:51", "text": "我该怎么做？我的意思是，我不应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11457.67, "timestamp": "03:10:57", "text": "到。什么？什么？什么？我应该怎么办？"}]